meTop>0</b></span></h2><span class=status id=status role=status><i></i>Paused</span></div> <div class=canvas-wrap><canvas aria-label="Particle grid. Use the initial-position tool to choose the starting cell, or pan and zoom the grid." id=board role=img tabindex=0></canvas> <div class=tools aria-label="Grid tools" role=toolbar><button class=tool aria-label="Set initial position S" title="Set initial position S" data-tool=start><span data-icon=start></span><kbd>S</kbd></button><span></span><button class="tool active" aria-label="Pan V" title="Pan V" data-tool=pan><span data-icon=hand></span><kbd>V</kbd></button></div> <div class=legend aria-label="Particle directions and matching cells" id=directionLegend></div> <div class=canvas-bottom><span id=hoverCoords>x — · y —</span><span id=gridScale>1 cell = 1 unit</span></div> <div class=zoom><button class=icon-button id=zoomOut aria-label="Zoom out" title="Zoom out"><span data-icon=minus></span></button><span id=zoomLabel>100%</span><button class=icon-button id=zoomIn aria-label="Zoom in" title="Zoom in"><span data-icon=plus></span></button><span></span><button class=icon-button id=fitGrid aria-label="Fit grid" title="Fit grid F"><span data-icon=fit></span></button><button class=icon-button id=fitParticles aria-label="Fit particles" title="Fit particles P"><span data-icon=start></span></button></div> </div> <div class=playback><div><button class=icon-button id=resetBtn aria-label="Reset to time 0" title="Reset to time 0 R"><span data-icon=reset></span></button><span class=divider></span><button class=icon-button id=prevBtn aria-label="Previous step" title="Previous step ←"><span data-icon=prev></span></button><button class=play-button id=playBtn aria-label=Play><span data-icon=play></span><span id=playLabel>Play</span></button><button class=icon-button id=nextBtn aria-label="Next step" title="Next step →"><span data-icon=next></span></button></div><div><select aria-label="Playback speed" id=speedSelect><option value=0.5>0.5×</option><option value=1 selected>1× speed</option><option value=2>2×</option><option value=4>4×</option></select><span class=divider></span><label class=time-input>t <input id=timeInput type=number max=200 min=0 value=0 step=1 aria-label="Simulation time"></label><button class=small-button id=goTime>Go</button></div></div> <div class=time-track><label for=scrubber>Progress</label><input id=scrubber type=range max=200 min=0 value=0 aria-label=Progress><span id=timeLimit>0–200 steps</span></div> </section> <div class=metrics><section class=metric><span data-icon=grid class=metric-icon></span><div><p>Current matching cells <span id=currentHitTime>t = 0</span></p><strong id=currentHits>1</strong><small>cells</small></div></section><section class="metric query-metric"><span data-icon=line class="metric-icon amber"></span><div><p>Query result <span id=resultTime>t = 0</span></p><strong id=queryResult>1</strong><small id=resultUnit>cells</small></div></section></div> </div> <aside aria-label=Setup class="card settings"><div class=card-head><h2>Setup</h2><span class=save-state id=saveState><i></i>Saved in browser</span></div> <form class=settings-section id=initialForm novalidate><div class=field-title><h3>Initial conditions</h3><span>Time 0</span></div><label class=field-label for=nInput>Grid size n (2–30)</label><input id=nInput type=number max=30 min=2 value=8 step=1 required><div class=two-fields><label class=field-label>Initial x₀<input id=xInput type=number max=30 min=1 value=4 step=1 required></label><label class=field-label>Initial y₀<input id=yInput type=number max=30 min=1 value=4 step=1 required></label></div><button class="button secondary apply" type=submit>Apply initial conditions<span data-icon=check></span></button><p class=field-note>Applying initial conditions resets the time to 0.</p><p class=error id=initialError role=status></p></form> <form class=settings-section id=queryForm novalidate><div class=field-title><h3>Line query</h3></div><p class=equatio